-- ============================================================
-- Connect TVC — bulk sample data for testing (DFW metro).
-- Additive: 25 more groups (ids g6-g30) + 100 more people
-- (ids p001-p100). Does not touch the original 5+5 seed rows.
-- Real DFW-area street addresses so the existing geocoding /
-- "Place N on map" backfill produces a realistic, spread-out map.
-- Deliberately varied across day/time/status/format/frequency/
-- childcare/dates (groups) and area/life-stage/status/days/
-- childcare/dates (people), per request.
--
-- Run AFTER schema.sql + 003_person_geo_and_status.sql.
-- Safe to re-run (ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING — these are new fixed ids,
-- not meant to be edited back to seed values like seed.sql's rows).
-- ============================================================

